#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your skills in practical quantum computing, and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Realiza un examen de 20 preguntas en el sitio de IBM Training para poner a prueba tus habilidades en computación cuántica práctica, y recibe una insignia a través de Credly."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Quantum computing in practice"
msgstr "Examen | Computación cuántica en la práctica"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Examen e insignia {#exam-and-badge}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/exam/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/exam/badge.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Encuesta posterior al curso {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing the \"Quantum computing in practice\" course by IBM&reg;!\n"
msgstr "¡Felicidades por completar el curso \"Computación cuántica en la práctica\" de IBM&reg;!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Pon a prueba tus conocimientos {#test-your-knowledge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for Quantum computing in practice.\n"
msgstr "Después de completar las lecturas y actividades de este curso, haz clic en el botón de abajo para ir a IBM Training, donde puedes realizar el examen de insignia de Computación cuántica en la práctica.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "El examen consta de 20 preguntas, y debes responder correctamente al menos 16 para aprobar. Al recibir una calificación aprobatoria, tu insignia se enviará automáticamente al correo electrónico que usaste para registrarte en IBM Training.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Asegúrate de estar listo para realizar el examen. Si no obtienes una calificación aprobatoria en dos intentos, el examen queda bloqueado temporalmente.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/quantum-computing-in-practice-DL46111G\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
msgstr "AVISO: IBM aprovecha los servicios de Credly, un procesador de datos externo autorizado por IBM y ubicado en los Estados Unidos, para ayudar en la administración del programa de Insignias Digitales de IBM. Para poder emitirte una Insignia Digital de IBM, tu información personal (nombre, dirección de correo electrónico e insignia obtenida) se compartirá con Credly. Recibirás una notificación por correo electrónico de Credly con instrucciones para reclamar la insignia. Tu información personal se utiliza para emitir tu insignia y para fines de generación de informes y operativos del programa. IBM puede compartir la información personal recopilada con subsidiarias de IBM y terceros a nivel mundial. Se manejará de manera coherente con las prácticas de privacidad de IBM. La Declaración de Privacidad de IBM se puede consultar [aquí](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
